# 100-Day Growth System — Environment Variables & Cross-Device Cloud Sync
# Deploying on Vercel: Connect ONE of the options below to sync data in real time between Mobile and PC.

# ==============================================================================
# OPTION 1: Turso libSQL Cloud (RECOMMENDED - Free SQLite Cloud Database)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Run `turso db create krishna-growth` or sign up at https://turso.tech (Free)
# 2. Get database URL and auth token:
#    `turso db show krishna-growth --url`
#    `turso db tokens create krishna-growth`
# 3. Add these two environment variables in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL="https://krishna-growth-yourname.turso.io"
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN="your-turso-jwt-token"

# ==============================================================================
# OPTION 2: Vercel KV / Upstash Redis (1-Click in Vercel Marketplace)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. In your Vercel Dashboard, go to your project -> "Storage" tab
# 2. Click "Create Database" -> choose "KV (Upstash Redis)"
# 3. Vercel automatically populates these variables into your project:
# KV_REST_API_URL="https://your-upstash-redis-url.upstash.io"
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN="your-upstash-redis-token"

# ==============================================================================
# OPTION 3: Cloudflare D1 via REST API
# ==============================================================================
# If you have an existing Cloudflare D1 database:
# CLOUDFLARE_D1_DATABASE_ID="your-d1-database-uuid"
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID="your-cloudflare-account-id"
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN="your-cloudflare-api-token"

# ==============================================================================
# MV33 AI GROWTH COACH & ADVANCED MODULAR RAG AGENT
# ==============================================================================
# The RAG agent works out of the box with zero keys using its built-in
# Grounded Rule-Based Synthesizer. To enable Gemini 2.5 Flash or GPT-4o-mini
# generation, add one of the keys below:
# GEMINI_API_KEY="AIzaSy..."
# OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."

